                <pb facs="0577" n="507" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg507"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Acting Assistant Adjutant-General Turner to Lieutenant
                        Doane.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Headquarters District of Montana</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#small-caps">Helena, Mont.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1883-05-13"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi>
                            13, 1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to your telegram of the 12th instant, district commander directs that
                    you take their arms from them, and when all the Crees have been collected send
                    them under escort to Fort Assinniboine and turn them over to the commanding
                    officer at that post.</p>
                <p>By order of Colonel Ruger.</p>
                <closer><signed>TURNER,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting Assistant
                            Adjutant-General.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
